  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Humanity is fighting against rogue robots, The robots found a new way
    to cause mass level distruction. <b>Energy CORE</b>, a source of high energy,
    if it is charged to the limit, it can cause enormous distruction. \n\nThe robots
    use laser guns to charge energy core. The energy core scales in size as it get
    charged.\n\nYour job is to eliminate all robots and prevent them from charging
    Energy Core. \n\n"
